Error [E0083]: `{` opened on line 1 is never closed
  --> tests/ui/unclosed_brace_block.jet:1:10
    |
  1 | fn run() {
    |          ^
  --> tests/ui/unclosed_brace_block.jet:2:19
    |
  2 |     print("hello")
    |                   ^ the end of the file comes before the closing `}`
 Why: Every `{` needs a matching `}`, but the end of the file came first
 Fix: Add `}` where the block ends
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0083
